<span class="text-content" data-text="best-in-slot-gear">
<div class="thumbnail-container">
<span class="thumbnail" data-border-type="loud" data-size="small">
<span class="thumbnail-icon">
<img/></span></span></div>Best in Slot Gear</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper exclude-units">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>As a <span class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_deathknight.gif");'></span>
<span class="c6">Blood Death Knight</span>, the nature of our gearing becomes ever complicated by our focus on different stats for different content. Before taking a look at the best-in-slot (BIS) gear listed below, it is advisable to make yourself familiar with the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/death-knight/blood/tank-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priority</a> in Mists of Pandaria. <br/>
<br/>While we generally pursue <b>Parry</b> and <b>Dodge</b> as our main stats, they are neither the most defensive nor the most offensive stats in our toolkit, instead offering a balanced approach that offers good offensive utility while not neglecting defense. Pursuing items with these stats also allows you to have 0 competition on loot, making the gearing process much easier. <br/>
<br/>There will be bosses in raids where it will not be beneficial to have blindly pursued Parry and Dodge, however, and building appropriate sets for those bosses will be advised.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_dungeon_gloryofthehero.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best-in-Slot Gear for Blood Death Knight</span></h2>This is an example of the best-in-slot gear available from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift. <br/>
<br/>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
<div class="tabs-wrapper exclude-units" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%;">
<div id="dsf67g4d-mop-phase-3">
<div class="tabs-container">
<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" data-href="#mop-phase-3-phase-3-pre-bis" data-selected="true" role="tab" tabindex="0">
<div>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/small/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.jpg");'></span>Phase 3 Pre-BIS</div></button>
<div class="vertical-scroll-shadow"></div>
<div class="horizontal-scroll-shadow"></div></div></div></div>
<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-mop-phase-3-phase-3-pre-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<br/></div>
<br/>This gearset omits loot from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69099/nalak">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Nalak</span></a> due to the RNG nature of world bosses. Similarly, <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a> gear past Friendly is realistically gained by killing mobs and bosses in the raid, as it's a very slow and arduous process to gain reputation through doing dailies on <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6507/isle-of-thunder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Isle of Thunder</span></a>. Loot from these sources will generally be better than the alternatives listed below. <br/>
<br/>
<div class="exclude-units">
