<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Blood Death Knights</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it is very important to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not a true "best in slot" list, as better alternatives are available from other forms of content. These items will be your best option until you can pursue those options.<br/>
