<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Blood Death Knights</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. World Bosses, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>, will offer raid-equivalent loot and will serve as this expansion's <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=5600/baradin-hold">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baradin Hold</span></a> equivalent.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c6" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_zandalaribabyraptorwhite.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=69161/oondasta">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Oondasta</span></a> is one of the two Phase 3-specific world bosses. Unlike his World Boss counterparts, he does not drop any tier items, but he drops a wide selection of gear at item level 522. <br/>
<br/>Most of the gear listed below will be upgrades over the less RNG-prone items in the BIS list.<ul class="exclude-units">
